@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram


[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / display journey details
Login : do / view journey details
Login : exit / user decides to activate driving mode or choose other options

state "Activate Mode" as ActivateMode <<choice>>
Login --> ActivateMode

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / enter driving mode
DrivingMode : do / perform driving actions
DrivingMode : exit / end driving mode

state FoodSelection
FoodSelection : entry / select place to eat
FoodSelection : do / view menu and order food if hungry
FoodSelection : exit / finish food selection

state AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / notify authorities in case of accident
AccidentNotification : do / send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
AccidentNotification : exit / end notification process

state FeedbackCollection
FeedbackCollection : entry / collect user feedback upon journey completion
FeedbackCollection : do / provide feedback
FeedbackCollection : exit / end feedback collection

@enduml
